## Guidelines

- **Tailwind**: Prefer utilities for layout, spacing, color, and responsive behavior. Keep class order consistent.
- **MUI**: Use for complex components (dialogs, menus, icons) when it speeds delivery. Emotion is available; if adding a theme, wrap it in [src/app/layout.tsx](mdc:src/app/layout.tsx).
- **Fonts**: Configured via `next/font` in layout. Keep CSS variables on `<body>` as in [src/app/layout.tsx](mdc:src/app/layout.tsx).

## Tips

- Favor semantic HTML and accessible attributes. Keep overrides minimal.
- Avoid mixing inline styles with Tailwind unless necessary.

